1
00:00:00,322 --> 00:00:02,352
(Sheldon:)Never mind.

2
00:00:04,159 --> 00:00:06,889
(Sheldon:)You know, Penny went to this spa
to be away from you.

3
00:00:06,895 --> 00:00:08,665
(Sheldon:)Are you sure
you should be going there?

4
00:00:08,663 --> 00:00:11,433
(Leonard:)I don't want to wait two days
for us to work this out.

5
00:00:11,433 --> 00:00:13,433
(Sheldon:)Very well.

6
00:00:13,435 --> 00:00:15,165
(Sheldon:)You got married
spur of the moment.

7
00:00:15,170 --> 00:00:18,000
(Sheldon:)I don't see why your
divorce should be any different.

8
00:00:19,207 --> 00:00:21,107
(Leonard:)I would pull this car over
and kick you out,

9
00:00:21,109 --> 00:00:25,209
(Leonard:)but... if Penny dumps me,
you're all I got.

10
00:00:28,350 --> 00:00:31,180
(Penny:)When was the last time
you got a massage?

11
00:00:31,186 --> 00:00:33,086
(Amy:)Sheldon walked on my back
two weeks ago,

12
00:00:33,088 --> 00:00:35,188
(Amy:)but that was just 'cause
there was a spider on his pillow

13
00:00:35,190 --> 00:00:37,460
(Amy:)and he was trying to get away.

14
00:00:37,459 --> 00:00:39,659
(Penny:)Leonard stood on me once, too,

15
00:00:39,661 --> 00:00:43,261
(Penny:)but he was just trying
to see the Rose Parade.

16
00:00:44,633 --> 00:00:45,733
(Amy:)I don't know the protocol,

17
00:00:45,734 --> 00:00:47,934
(Amy:)are you gonna be naked
for your massage?

18
00:00:47,936 --> 00:00:49,106
(Penny:)Well. Yeah.

19
00:00:49,104 --> 00:00:52,704
(Amy:)Hmm. Then this is probably
too many clothes.

20
00:00:54,309 --> 00:00:55,579
(Leonard:)Hey.

21
00:00:55,577 --> 00:00:57,047
(Penny:)What are you doing here?

